  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Culture|2030 Indicators is a framework of thematic indicators whose purpose is to measure and monitor the progress of culture&apos;s enabling contribution to the national and local implementation of the Goals and Targets of the 2030 Agenda for Sustainable Development. The project aims at the pilot implementation of this thematic framework at national and local level in Colombia and the Philippines.</narrative>
